#: eucitizensciencetheme_ecsa/templates/old/_what_is_citizen_science_old.html:9
#: eucitizensciencetheme_portugal/templates/_what_is_citizen_science.html:9
msgid "what is <span class='text-white'>citizen science?</span>"
msgstr ""
"Qu’est-ce que la <span class='text-white'>science participative?</span>"

#: eucitizensciencetheme_ecsa/templates/old/_what_is_citizen_science_old.html:12
#: eucitizensciencetheme_portugal/templates/_what_is_citizen_science.html:12
#: themes/eucitizenscience/templates/_what_is_citizen_science.html:12
msgid ""
"Citizen science is any activity that involves the public in scientific "
"research and thus has the potential to bring together science, policy "
"makers, and society as a whole in an impactful way. Through citizen science, "
"all people can participate in many stages of the scientific process, from "
"the design of the research question, to data collection and volunteer "
"mapping, data interpretation and analysis, and to publication and "
"dissemination of results. Citizen science is also an approach of scientific "
"work that may be used as a part of a broader scientific activity."
msgstr ""
"Les sciences participatives impliquent activement le public dans la "
"recherche scientifique qui génère de nouvelles connaissances ou une "
"meilleure compréhension, et a donc le potentiel de rassembler la science, "
"les décideurs politiques et la société dans son ensemble de manière "
"efficace. A travers la science participative, les citoyens peuvent "
"participer à différentes étapes du processus scientifique, de la formulation "
"du problème scientifique, à la collecte de données et la cartographie de "
"bénévoles, en passant par l'interpretéation des données et leur analyse et "
"enfin à la publication et dissemination des résultats. La science "
"participative c'est également une approche du travail scientifique qui peut "
"être utile  à une activité scientifique plus large. "

#: eucitizensciencetheme_ecsa/templates/old/_what_is_citizen_science_old.html:16
#: eucitizensciencetheme_portugal/templates/_what_is_citizen_science.html:16
msgid ""
"Learn more about it with the <a href='/resource/88'>ECSA 10 Principles of "
"Citizen Science</a> and the <a href='/resource/87'>ECSA Characteristics of "
"Citizen Science!</a>"
msgstr ""
"Pour en savoir plus, consultez les <a href='/resource/88'>10 Principes de "
"sciences participatives d’ECSA </a>et les <a href='/resource/87'> "
"Characteristics of Citizen Science (Caractéristiques des sciences "
"participatives) d’ECSA!</a>"

