msgid ""
"EU-Citizen.Science is an online platform for sharing knowledge, tools, "
"training and resources for citizen science – by the community, for the "
"community."
msgstr ""
"EU-Citizen.Science est une plate-forme en ligne dédiée au partage de "
"connaissances, d’outils, de formations et de ressources en sciences "
"participatives - créée par la communauté et pour la communauté."

#: eucitizensciencetheme_portugal/templates/about.html:98
#: themes/eucitizenscience/templates/about.html:98
#: themes/italia/templates/about.html:98
msgid ""
"The vision for the platform is to serve as a Knowledge Hub, in aid of the "
"mainstreaming of citizen science, and build on the growing impact of "
"citizens participating in research across the full range of scientific "
"enquiry. We accomplish this by supporting the sharing of knowledge, know-"
"how, and experience between anyone doing or wanting to do citizen science."
msgstr ""
"La vision de la plate-forme est de servir de Centre de Connaissance, aider à "
"généraliser la science participative, et s’appuyer sur l’impact croissant "
"des citoyens participant à la recherche dans tout l’éventail de la recherche "
"scientifique. Cela est rendu possible grace à la mise en partage des "
"connaissances, du savoir-faire, et de l'expérience des personnes qui "
"pratiquent ou qui souhaitent pratiquer la science participative."

